 r←Test_Input_Misc_001(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT
⍝ Exercise "Input" with just the bare minimum of data and properties.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 defMat⍪←'Name' 'Enter your name:' ''DT.Character
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat ⍬ ⍬

 n.Name ∆KeyPress'Kai Jaeger'
 ⎕NQ n.∆OK'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →PassesIf 1=↑⍴n.∆result
 →PassesIf'Kai Jaeger'≡1⊃n.∆result[0;]

 r←∆OK
